# LF everywhere, including in Windows working copies.
#
# manifest.json carries a sha256 for every file, and a checksum is over bytes.
# Without this, git hands a Windows author CRLF on checkout, `build-manifest.mjs`
# hashes those bytes, and the manifest disagrees with the one CI computes on
# Linux from the same commit -- for every text file at once, with nothing on
# screen to explain why.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff2 binary
